{"3989010": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dead Z Meat", "steam_appid": 3989010, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989010/extras/0ffa8467a9441dead9c3c66644be6d6c.avif?t=1773654641\" width=800 height=151 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Z Virus has turned the world into a living nightmare. Cities lie in ruins, streets are crawling with the undead, and the last survivors are hiding in fear, praying for a miracle. Humanity is on the brink of extinction… and the final hope rests on you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989010/extras/3f6107f997faed9e9300ad3f85cff575.poster.avif?t=1773654641\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989010/extras/3f6107f997faed9e9300ad3f85cff575.webm?t=1773654641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989010/extras/3f6107f997faed9e9300ad3f85cff575.mp4?t=1773654641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the lone fighter who dares to stand against the endless zombie swarms. But survival alone is not enough. Scattered across the land are the fragments of a powerful antidote — the only cure that can stop the Z Virus and save the remnants of humankind. To claim them, you’ll have to carve your way through hordes of the infected, face terrifying bosses, and make life-or-death decisions on a board-game style map where every step matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989010/extras/aef12c8167739efc9b147d86b3944988.poster.avif?t=1773654641\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989010/extras/aef12c8167739efc9b147d86b3944988.webm?t=1773654641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989010/extras/aef12c8167739efc9b147d86b3944988.mp4?t=1773654641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dead Z Meat</strong> is a fast-paced zombie shooter with arcade-style action, tactical map progression, and a clear goal: collect all pieces of the cure and end the apocalypse once and for all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989010/extras/84a73d25492638768c3cca41daafa085.avif?t=1773654641\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you take the safer path to survive a little longer, or risk everything for greater rewards? The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989010/extras/ed10f9d8a970b0fa23a29c132d6b51be.avif?t=1773654641\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME MODES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Survival</strong> – face endless waves of zombies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sniper Challenge</strong> – every bullet counts in high-pressure precision shooting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss Fights</strong> – take down monstrous abominations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defense Missions</strong> – protect the “barrel” from relentless swarms.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🗺️ <strong>Board-game style progression</strong> – choose your path across a branching map and hunt down every piece of the cure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚡ <strong>Fast-paced arcade action</strong> – non-stop zombie blasting with escalating difficulty.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔫 <strong>9 unique weapons</strong> – each upgradable for even more destructive power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💣 <strong>Power-ups and abilities</strong> – supercharge your arsenal and turn the tide of battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧟 <strong>Reactive zombie hordes</strong> – enemies adapt and grow more aggressive the longer you last.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎨 <strong>Stylized visuals</strong> – cartoon-inspired graphics with smooth animations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive. Upgrade. Collect the cure. <br>Do you have what it takes to stop the Z Virus once and for all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989010/extras/8dc767b225725f25361eff82754827ea.avif?t=1773654641\" width=800 height=200 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989010/extras/0ffa8467a9441dead9c3c66644be6d6c.avif?t=1773654641\" width=800 height=151 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Z Virus has turned the world into a living nightmare. Cities lie in ruins, streets are crawling with the undead, and the last survivors are hiding in fear, praying for a miracle. Humanity is on the brink of extinction… and the final hope rests on you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\